 "6.png", "id": "781648797642946", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303391_781648800976279_3105583507634483960_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b65pJ6v9EMsQ7kNvwGM6RK-&_nc_oc=AdoY1Jh0OwPZicWN2qzQDOU3cW6EuVQuaQTkeqREYHHxlmW-Kv8iqxvH17U2POf9ACc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIYVko0nnmST_SM0--7DcgYD_e67aF49viwKqGDLAPZLg&oe=6AA2B920"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Fruit Smash - Fruit Archery Game", "keywords": ["FruitGames", "FruitSmash", "Archery", "Bow", "ShootingGames"], "long_description": "Fruit Smash puts you in the middle of a colorful orchard where your mission is simple but thrilling smash as many flying fruits as you can using your bow and arrows! Experience the rush of precision archery in fully immersive VR as apples, pineapples, watermelons, and more soar through the air, just waiting to be sliced apart.\n\nWith intuitive controls, realistic bow mechanics, and vibrant environments, every shot feels satisfying. Challenge yourself in different modes, improve your accuracy, and climb the leaderboard. Whether you\u2019re a casual player looking for some juicy fun or a competitive archer aiming for perfection, this is your ultimate VR fruit-smashing adventure.", "short_description": "Step into the orchard, grab your bow, and take aim! Smash  fruits in this fast-paced VR archery challenge that tests your precision, speed, and focus.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Abstron Pvt Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "269